---
/**
 * ProfileCard: Open Editorial Studio Gating (Unboxed)
 * Displayed only when the author's shipping address or phone number is missing.
 * Aligns naturally with header (max-w-5xl), no container box.
 */
---

<div id="profile-card" class="w-full hidden mb-8 border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-10">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 min-h-[460px]">
    <!-- Sisi Kiri: Editorial & Publishing Value Props (5 Kolom / ~42%) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between py-2">
      <div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange/10 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-orange">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange"></span>
          Langkah Awal Penulis
        </span>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-navy tracking-tight">
          Satu Langkah Menuju Cetak Pertama
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2.5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          Setiap karya sastra di Novella.id dirawat dengan standar redaksi profesional dan dikirimkan aman langsung ke tangan Anda.
        </p>

        <!-- Value Props -->
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-orange/10 text-orange">
              <svg class="h-4.5 w-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy">Eksemplar Fisik Bergaransi</h3>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Dikemas bubble wrap tebal dan dikirim melalui kurir resmi hingga ke alamat Anda.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600">
              <svg class="h-4.5 w-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy">Pendampingan Redaksi WhatsApp</h3>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Live update naskah: pemeriksaan isi, tata letak interior, cover, hingga nomor resi.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5">
            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-amber-600">
              <svg class="h-4.5 w-4.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-navy">100% Hak Cipta Milik Penulis</h3>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-slate-500">Karya seutuhnya milik Anda tanpa ikatan pengalihan hak komersial sepihak.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Seal / Footnote -->
      <div class="mt-8 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-slate-600">
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-orange" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.267 3.455a3.066 3.066 0 001.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 013.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 001.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 012.812 2.812c.051.643.304 1.254.723 1.745a3.066 3.066 0 010 3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723 1.745 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812 2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-3.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812-2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 010-3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 012.812-2.812zm7.44 5.252a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          Standar Redaksi Novella
        </span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-slate-400 tracking-wider">NOVELLA.ID STUDIO</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sisi Kanan: Form Profil Presisi (7 Kolom / ~58%) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 border-t lg:border-t-0 lg:border-l border-slate-200/80 lg:pl-10 pt-6 lg:pt-0 flex flex-col justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-orange/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-orange">
            Data Pengiriman Buku
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">Wajib · ±1 Menit</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold text-navy tracking-tight">Lengkapi Profil Pengiriman</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            Data ini disimpan di profil akun Anda untuk keperluan pengiriman eksemplar buku cetak dan koordinasi redaksi naskah.
          </p>
        </div>

        <form id="profile-complete-form" class="mt-6 space-y-4">
          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-navy">
              Nomor WhatsApp Aktif <span class="text-rose-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <div class="relative mt-1.5 flex rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white focus-within:border-navy focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-navy/5 shadow-xs transition-all">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 border-r border-slate-200 px-3 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 bg-slate-50 rounded-l-xl">
                <span>🇮🇩</span> +62
              </span>
              <input
                id="input-phone"
                type="tel"
                required
                placeholder="Contoh: 08123456789"
                class="w-full rounded-r-xl px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:outline-none"
              />
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-500">Tim redaksi akan mengirimkan update proses penerbitan ke nomor ini.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-navy">
              Alamat Lengkap Pengiriman Buku Cetak <span class="text-rose-500">*</span>
            </label>
            <textarea
              id="input-address"
              rows="3"
              required
              placeholder="Jalan, No. Rumah/Gedung, RT/RW, Kelurahan, Kecamatan, Kota/Kabupaten, Kode Pos (Sertakan patokan jika ada)"
              class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-800 placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-navy focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-navy/5 shadow-xs transition-all"
            ></textarea>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-slate-500">Pastikan alamat jelas agar kurir dapat mengantarkan buku tepat waktu.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="group flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-orange py-3.5 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-md shadow-orange/20 hover:bg-orange-hover transition-all hover:scale-[1.01] active:scale-[0.99] cursor-pointer"
            >
              <span>Simpan & Buka Portal Penerbitan</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 border-t border-slate-100 pt-3 text-center">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium">
          <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-slate-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
          </svg>
          Data privasi Anda aman dan hanya digunakan untuk keperluan pengiriman eksemplar.
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
